OL,3,AAnti-migrant activist charged after
OL,4,Adinghy slashed in Channel
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral hundred people had gathered
OL,7,Foutside a police investigation centre
OL,8,Fin Basingstoke on Thursday evening
OL,9,Fbelieving Thomas was inside.
